=========================================================================================

6.1. Non-Commercial Status. This License permits FREE use for non-commercial entities, 
     independent researchers, and open-source contributors adhering to the Seraphic 
     Standard.

6.2. Commercial Deployment. If the Licensee intends to distribute a compiled plugin 
     (VST3, AU, CLAP, AAX) containing the Software for monetary gain, a separate 
     Seraphic Commercial Enterprise License (SCEL) must be negotiated. 

6.3. Forking and Rebranding. You may fork the codebase, but the name "Seraphic 
     Technologies", "Smoothie Elite", "IronStack", and "SeFi-Sam" remain the exclusive 
     trademarks of the Licensor. A commercial fork must completely strip all Seraphic 
     branding while still maintaining the architectural compliance mandated in Article II.

